---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/common/Button.astro";
import { PLAY_URL } from "../consts";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="What Earth Doom is and how to start playing.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-14 md:px-8 md:pt-20">
    <h1 class="text-display font-bold text-ink">About Earth Doom</h1>
    <div class="prose mt-8">
      <p>
        Earth Doom is a free strategy game of raids and rivals, played in your
        browser. You build an economy from nothing, find and develop land, raise
        an army and send it against other players to carry their land home.
      </p>
      <p>
        The game runs in ticks. Every tick pays out your income and counts down
        everything you have queued, so you play in short visits: check in, give
        your orders and come back later.
      </p>
      <p>
        New to the game? The <a href="/manual/">manual</a> walks you through your
        first days, from the first tax collectors to your first attack.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <Button href={PLAY_URL} size="lg">Play now</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
